# DR runbook variables: real bucket/project/service-account literals live here,
# untracked, so the published documents can stay parameterised.
dr-vars.env

# Secret scanning output
*.sarif
gitleaks-report*
trivy-report*

# Agent/tool local state
.claude/
.qoder/

# Evidence (sensitive, access-controlled)
# incident-response/evidence/

# PyCharm "New Project" scaffold - never commit (drift-findings.md D-28).
# jolarca-security tracks main.py by mistake; do not repeat it here.
/main.py
